WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.372
"You left the palace?" Gildong said.

2
00:00:05.373 --> 00:00:09.153
He stared at the princess, looking worried.

3
00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:12.335
"You had better go back," he said.

4
00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:15.893
"When your servants learn that you are missing . . ."

5
00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:19.395
"I know." The princess nodded.

6
00:00:19.396 --> 00:00:20.953
"I must get back.

7
00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:23.737
But I do not know the way."

8
00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:26.504
"I do," said Gildong.

9
00:00:26.505 --> 00:00:29.468
"Please follow me, Your Highness."

10
00:00:29.469 --> 00:00:35.555
The children walked for a while and soon they could see the palace walls.

11
00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:39.212
"Wow!" Vinnie whispered.

12
00:00:39.213 --> 00:00:43.334
The princess stopped and looked at her new friends.

13
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:47.192
"Would you like to come inside?" she asked.

14
00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:49.948
"Yes!" cried Vinnie.

15
00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:54.750
"But we are not royalty, Your Highness," Gildong reminded her.

16
00:00:54.751 --> 00:00:57.338
"This is not allowed."

17
00:00:57.339 --> 00:01:01.760
"You are my friends," said the princess firmly.

18
00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.299
"So you are welcome here.

19
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.939
But there are guards everywhere," she added.

20
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.666
"We must be careful that you are not seen."

21
00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:14.380
They followed the princess.

22
00:01:14.381 --> 00:01:15.963
"You can enter there,"

23
00:01:15.964 --> 00:01:18.893
she said, pointing to the gate.

24
00:01:18.894 --> 00:01:21.471
"I will distract the guards."

25
00:01:21.472 --> 00:01:26.799
The princess went over to the guards and began talking to them.

26
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:31.284
When the guards turned around, Mandy slipped through the gate.

27
00:01:31.285 --> 00:01:34.887
Vinnie was next, followed by Gildong.

28
00:01:34.888 --> 00:01:38.986
A moment later the princess joined them.

29
00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:44.168
"Welcome to the palace!" she said happily.

30
00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:46.587
"I will show you around."

31
00:01:46.588 --> 00:01:49.731
They walked past a long wall.

32
00:01:49.732 --> 00:01:55.315
Gildong stopped to look at a grand building with two roofs.

33
00:01:55.316 --> 00:01:59.573
"That building must be very important," he said.

34
00:01:59.574 --> 00:02:02.607
"Yes," the princess said.

35
00:02:02.608 --> 00:02:04.816
"That's the throne hall.

36
00:02:04.817 --> 00:02:07.995
My father met with noblemen there."

37
00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:13.056
"Is your father the king of Korea?" asked Mandy.

38
00:02:13.057 --> 00:02:16.168
"No, not anymore . . ."

39
00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:20.398
The princess looked away as they walked on.

40
00:02:20.399 --> 00:02:25.048
"He died not long ago, and now there is a new king."

41
00:02:25.049 --> 00:02:30.200
"How sad . . . ," murmured Mandy.

42
00:02:30.201 --> 00:02:34.084
"Yes," the princess said with a sigh.

43
00:02:34.085 --> 00:02:39.719
"But my father, King Sejong, did many wonderful things for our people.

44
00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.853
During his time there were lots of new inventions."

45
00:02:43.854 --> 00:02:47.799
She stopped beside something on the ground.

46
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.012
"For example, this is a rain gauge.

47
00:02:51.013 --> 00:02:53.755
It was invented by scientists.

48
00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:56.144
They worked for my father."

49
00:02:56.145 --> 00:02:59.703
"What does it do?" asked Mandy.

50
00:02:59.704 --> 00:03:02.677
"It measures how much rain falls.

51
00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:06.921
People can tell if the harvest will be good or bad."

52
00:03:06.922 --> 00:03:09.547
They continued walking.

53
00:03:09.548 --> 00:03:13.788
Then Vinnie spotted something shaped like a bowl.

54
00:03:13.789 --> 00:03:15.899
"What is that?"

55
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:23.290
"A sundial. The famous scientist Jang Youngsil invented that type of sundial.

56
00:03:23.291 --> 00:03:27.456
It works like a clock," the princess said.

57
00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:30.463
Mandy studied the sundial.

58
00:03:30.464 --> 00:03:34.771
"What time is it now?" she asked the princess.

59
00:03:34.772 --> 00:03:39.051
"It is . . ." The princess bent closer.

60
00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:42.248
"Oh no!" She gasped.

61
00:03:42.249 --> 00:03:49.174
"It is time to go back to my room!"

